## Building Detection

Find all buildings. They appear as:
- Coded IDs: "B00A - Admin Building - 1924 - Brick" or "D01 - Demountable"
- Named buildings: "Building Name: Main Building" or building names as section headers
- If no coded IDs exist, generate sequential IDs (B001, B002...) and set `name` to the actual building name

Interior/Exterior sections within a building are NOT separate buildings.

## For Each Building Extract

- building_id: code (B00A, D01) or generated (B001)
- name: building name
- year: year built (integer or null)
- construction: construction type or null
- purpose: building purpose or null
- levels: number of levels or null
- page_start: first page with building data (from "--- Page N ---" markers)
- page_end: last page with building data
- complexity: "simple" (no ACM found, or <3 items) or "complex" (multiple rooms/items)
- rooms: list of rooms found (see schema below)
- acm_item_count_estimate: estimated ACM item count or null

## Room Schema

```json
{"room_id": "B001-R0001", "name": "Room Name", "area_m2": null, "page": null}
```

## Processing Groups

Group buildings by page proximity, targeting 3-5 pages per group:
```json
{"group_id": 1, "building_ids": ["B001"], "page_start": 1, "page_end": 4, "estimated_pages": 4}
```

## Output JSON Schema

```json
{
  "buildings": [
    {
      "building_id": "B001",
      "name": "Main Building",
      "year": 1985,
      "construction": "Brick",
      "purpose": null,
      "area_m2": null,
      "levels": 2,
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 8,
      "complexity": "complex",
      "rooms": [{"room_id": "R001", "name": "Foyer", "area_m2": null, "page": 3}],
      "acm_item_count_estimate": 15
    }
  ],
  "processing_groups": [
    {"group_id": 1, "building_ids": ["B001"], "page_start": 3, "page_end": 8, "estimated_pages": 6}
  ],
  "total_buildings": 1,
  "document_type": "ARA"
}
```

Respond with ONLY the JSON object. No explanations.
